<title>USA: Dynamex Inc acquires three companies.</title>
<headline>Dynamex Inc acquires three companies.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dynamex Inc said on Monday that it has acquired three same-day transportation operations in Dallas, Texas, which have combined annual revenues of $14 million.</p>
<p>Dynamex said it has purchased Max Distribution, One Hour Delivery and Priority Parcel Express for an undisclosed sum.</p>
